      "writtenOn": "2024-10-18T11:47:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "They use whatever memory you give them, their purpose is just to provide various forms of safe interior mutability. I\u0027m not sure why someone would expect them to do heap allocation internally, they aren\u0027t smart pointer types. In any case heap allocation isn\u0027t possible within a const context.",
      "parentUuid": "7460c558_2a236626",
